---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Portfolio | Rutledge Digital" description="Selected work and website case studies from Rutledge Digital.">
  <section class="page-hero section-pad"><div class="container narrow"><p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p><h1>Work that solves<br /><span>real problems.</span></h1><p class="hero-lede">This page is ready for your projects. Add real examples as you complete them, and explain the problem, your approach, and the outcome.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section-pad page-content"><div class="container"><div class="portfolio-grid"><article class="portfolio-card portfolio-placeholder"><div class="portfolio-visual visual-one"><span>PROJECT 01</span><div class="visual-window"><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Clear ideas.<br />Better outcomes.</b><small>Sample layout — replace with your work</small></div></div><div class="portfolio-meta"><div><p class="eyebrow">Case study placeholder</p><h2>Business website</h2></div><span class="portfolio-arrow">↗</span></div><p>Describe the client's challenge, what you built, and the measurable result. Only publish client work and metrics you have permission to share.</p></article><article class="portfolio-card portfolio-placeholder"><div class="portfolio-visual visual-two"><span>PROJECT 02</span><div class="visual-window store-window"><i></i><i></i><i></i><div class="product-shape"></div><b>Made for everyday.</b><small>Sample layout — replace with your work</small></div></div><div class="portfolio-meta"><div><p class="eyebrow">Case study placeholder</p><h2>E-commerce experience</h2></div><span class="portfolio-arrow">↗</span></div><p>Show how your design or technical choices made browsing, purchasing, or managing products easier.</p></article></div><div class="note-panel"><span class="note-icon">✳</span><div><h2>Just getting started?</h2><p>That's okay. Use personal projects, redesign concepts clearly labeled as concepts, or volunteer work with permission. A thoughtful explanation of your process is better than invented client results.</p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
